    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n4:42 am from Evans Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n6:42 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n8:57 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n11:12 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n5:19 am from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n7:41 am from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n9:56 am from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station"
    language: "en"
